Last Updated: September 18, 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how BambooSilk (the “App”), including its bundled BambooSilk Audio Unit extensions (“AUv3 Plug-ins”), handles information when you use the App on an Apple device.

1. PRIVACY AT A GLANCE

BambooSilk is designed to work locally on your device.

• We do not require you to create an account.
• We do not collect or transmit personal information to the developer.
• We do not use advertising, analytics, tracking, or profiling SDKs.
• We do not sell or share personal information.
• We do not operate a server that receives your audio, MIDI data, files, settings, or usage activity.

2. INFORMATION PROCESSED ON YOUR DEVICE

The App processes certain content locally so that its features can work. This locally processed content is not transmitted to the developer.

Audio Files You Choose to Import

When you use the system file picker, BambooSilk can access only the audio file or files you select. The App may copy a selected file into its private application storage and store basic library information such as the file name, title, duration, and date added. Imported audio is used for local playback, waveform display, and audio processing.

Performance Recordings

When you use the recording control in the performance view, BambooSilk records audio generated by the App and saves the resulting recording to the App’s local library. This feature does not record through the device microphone, and the current version of BambooSilk does not request microphone permission.

MIDI and Audio Processing

MIDI notes, controller messages, parameter changes, and audio buffers are processed in real time on the device. The bundled AUv3 Plug-ins do not send this content to the developer.

Preferences and Plug-in State

The App stores settings such as language choice, audio mixing preference, screen-awake preference, and the last selected audio effect using local Apple storage APIs. A compatible AUv3 host may also save plug-in parameters, presets, and state as part of the host’s own project or session.

3. DEVICE PERMISSIONS AND FILE ACCESS

BambooSilk uses Apple’s system file picker to let you choose audio files. The App does not scan unrelated files or gain general access to your file storage.

The current version does not request access to your microphone, camera, photos, contacts, location, health information, Bluetooth data, or advertising identifier.

If a future version requests an additional system permission, the App will explain the purpose of that permission before access is requested, and this Privacy Policy will be updated when required.

4. THIRD-PARTY AUv3 PLUG-INS AND HOST APPS

BambooSilk can discover and load compatible third-party AUv3 audio effects installed on your device. If you choose to load a third-party plug-in, the App provides audio to that plug-in for the processing you requested. Third-party plug-ins are separate software products that are not developed or controlled by BambooSilk. Their data practices, network activity, and privacy policies are the responsibility of their respective developers.

When a BambooSilk AUv3 Plug-in runs inside a third-party host app, the host controls the surrounding audio session, project storage, routing, and other host features. This Privacy Policy covers the BambooSilk AUv3 Plug-ins, but it does not cover the host app. Please review the privacy policy of any host app or third-party plug-in you use.

5. APPLE SERVICES

Apple distributes the App and may independently process information related to App Store downloads, purchases, device diagnostics, crash reports, or backups according to your device settings and Apple’s own policies. The developer does not control Apple’s processing of that information.

Depending on your Apple device and privacy settings, Apple may make aggregated or de-identified App Store analytics or diagnostic information available to the developer. This information is provided and governed by Apple; BambooSilk does not add its own analytics or tracking technology to the App.

You can learn more about Apple’s privacy practices at:
https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/

If iCloud Backup or another Apple backup service is enabled on your device, local App data may be included in a device backup managed by Apple. BambooSilk does not operate its own cloud-sync or backup service.

6. DATA SHARING, SALE, AND ADVERTISING

We do not sell, rent, license, or share personal information with advertisers, data brokers, or marketing companies. We do not use your information for cross-app tracking, targeted advertising, or behavioral profiling.

For purposes of applicable U.S. state privacy laws, including the California Consumer Privacy Act as amended by the California Privacy Rights Act, we do not “sell” or “share” personal information as those terms are defined by those laws.

7. DATA RETENTION AND DELETION

Because the developer does not receive your files or personal information, the developer does not retain them on a server.

Imported tracks, performance recordings, library metadata, and preferences remain on your device until you delete them through the App, remove the App, or erase the device. You can delete imported tracks and recordings from the App’s library. Deleting the App removes its local application container, subject to Apple-managed backups that may remain according to your Apple account and backup settings.

Projects or presets saved by a third-party AUv3 host must be deleted through that host. Data handled by a third-party plug-in must be managed according to that plug-in developer’s instructions.

8. SECURITY

BambooSilk relies on Apple platform protections, including app sandboxing and system-controlled file selection, to help protect locally stored content. No method of electronic storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security. Keeping your device software current and using a device passcode can help protect your local data.

9. CHILDREN’S PRIVACY

BambooSilk is not specifically directed to children under 13. The App does not knowingly collect personal information from children or other users. If you believe information has been provided to the developer in connection with the App, please contact us using the information below.

10. INTERNATIONAL DATA TRANSFERS

BambooSilk does not transmit personal information to the developer’s servers and therefore does not perform international transfers of user data. Apple, a host app, or a third-party plug-in may process information under its own terms and privacy policy.

11. YOUR PRIVACY CHOICES

You control which audio files you import, which recordings you keep, and which third-party AUv3 plug-ins you load. You may delete local library items at any time and may remove all locally stored App data by deleting the App.

Because we do not maintain user accounts or a server-side database of user information, we generally have no personal data to access, correct, export, or delete on your behalf. You may still contact us with any privacy question or request.

12. CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY

We may update this Privacy Policy if the App’s features, data practices, or legal requirements change. The revised policy will show a new “Last Updated” date. Material changes will be communicated through an appropriate channel, such as the App’s product page, an in-app notice, or the website where this policy is published.

